ents in American history to life. -- adapted from jacket  aIngrambShelf ready books10aHouston, Sam,d1793-1863.10aSanta Anna, Antonio López de,d1794-1876. 0aTexasxHistoryyRevolution, 1835-1836. 0aSan Jacinto, Battle of, Tex., 1836. 0aAlamo (San Antonio, Tex.)xSiege, 1836. 0aGovernorszTexasvBiography. 0aLegislatorszUnited StatesvBiography. 0aTexasxHistoryyTo 1846. 1aTexas 1aTexaszSan Antonio. 1aTexasxHistory. 7aHISTORYzUnited Statesx19th Century. 7aUnited StatesxHistoryxState & LocalxSouthwest (AZ, NM, OK, TX) 7aLegislators. 7aAlamo (San Antonio, Tex.), Battle of the, 1836. 7aBattle of San Jacintoc(Texas :d1836)2fast0(OCoLC)fst01404392 7aRevolutionc(Texas :d1835-1836)2fast0(OCoLC)fst01354582 7aSiege of Alamoc(San Antonio, Texas :d1836)2fast0(OCoLC)fst01910462 7aTo 18462fast 7aBiographies.08iOnline version:aKilmeade, Brian.tSam Houston and the Alamo avengers.dNew York : Sentinel, 2019z9780525540564w(DLC)  2019022818  a92bTNTffaF390 .H84 K55 2019wLCc1i50706010953454f6/2/2025g2lSTACKSmERCp$28.00rYsYtBOOKu3/19/2021xBOOK00847cam a2200265   4500001000800000003000600008005001700014008004100031040003000072020001800102020001500120035002200135050002200157049000900179100001700188245006000205260003600265300002300301590003000324650002300354650003800377650002300415994001200438945013100450u581759SIRSI20210613042801.5200817s2020    xx            000 0 eng d  aTOHbengcTOHdJCHdOCLCO  a9780062999719  a0062999710  a(OCoLC)1192354301 0aKF4772b.C67 2020  aMAIN1 aCose, Ellis.10aShort Life and Curious Death of Free Speech in America.  bHarperCollins Publishersc2020.  a208 pages.;c23 cm  aIngrambShelf ready books 0aPolitical culture. 0aFreedom of speechzUnited States. 7aFreedom of speech.  a92bTNTffaKF4772 .C67 2020wLCc1i50706010960863d3/25/2022e3/9/2022f6/4/2025g3lSTACKSmERCn2p$23.99rYsYtBOOKu6/14/2021xBOOK01417cam a2200409   u